{"id":"n32482-1-9","stage":2,"title":"기관 · 引擎","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32482-1-9-1","ko":"도착 시간이 지났는데 왜 배가 안 오지?","zh":"已经过了预计到达的时间，为什么船还没来？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"도착","meaning":"到达","explanation":"도착：到达","readings":[{"term":"도착","audio":"/audio/103f83573455f3b61eed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64543","senseId":"1","lemma":"도착","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"2","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지났는데","meaning":"过，过去","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배가","meaning":"船","explanation":"배：船；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29729","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오지?","meaning":"来，开来","explanation":"오다：来，开来；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"3","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"103f83573455f3b6","term":"도착","zh":"到达","audio":"/audio/103f83573455f3b61eed.mp3","entryId":"64543","definition":"抵达目的地。","pronunciation":["도ː착"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"为了做某事而定下的时刻；或指一天中的某个时刻。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过，过去","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"随时间流逝，脱离那个时期。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"船","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"29729","definition":"运载人或东西，在水上行驶的交通工具。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，开来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"交通工具朝着某个基准的地方运行。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/59bee5d7c20f0a1ce1c9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n32482-1-9-2","ko":"기관 고장으로 출발이 늦어졌대.","zh":"据说因为引擎故障，出发时间被推迟了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기관","meaning":"引擎，发动机","explanation":"기관：引擎，发动机","readings":[{"term":"기관","audio":"/audio/5d78ce2d4d5f697d5065.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32482","senseId":"1","lemma":"기관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고장으로","meaning":"故障","explanation":"고장：故障；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"고장","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18856","senseId":"1","lemma":"고장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"출발이","meaning":"出发","explanation":"출발：出发；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"출발","audio":"/audio/c92d127244fd943f6a04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72140","senseId":"1","lemma":"출발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늦어졌대.","meaning":"晚，迟到；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词